# Third-party artwork — Leder Games / Kyle Ferrin. Shipped with the app, on the same footing as
# the Arcs Tabletop Simulator mod, which hosts it with the creators' approval.
#
# Kept out of git for size, not permission: 72 MB across 918 binaries that git would carry in
# history forever. It is uploaded by the deploy instead — see docs/16.
assets/images/
*.part

node_modules/
dist/

# Output of `npm run fit`. Regenerable, and no fitted set has ever beaten the hand-set weights
# (docs/19 sections 3f-3i) — so committing one would look like a recommendation rather than a
# reproducible experiment.
packages/engine/src/ai/fitted-weights*.json
.DS_Store
